Lucas, you just want to put

\include{diff_slum}

in the appropriate place in your main doc. Knitr will respect the raw latex command. But you have to strip the

\documentclass[]{article}
\setlength{\pdfpagewidth}{8.5in} \setlength{\pdfpageheight}{11in}
\begin{document}

and

\end{document}

from your included file.

