That was a typo. You need to remove the extra parenthesis in the function body:

knit_hooks$set(document = function(x) {
  sub('\\usepackage{graphicx, color}',

'\\usepackage{graphicx,xcolor}', x, fixed = TRUE)

})

Regards,
Yihui
